{"product_id":"anything-for-her","title":"Anything For Her","description":"\u003cp\u003e\"When Billy Orr returns home to spend time with his dying sister, he bumps into his ex-girlfriend Aimi, the love of his life. He might not have seen her in eleven years, but Billy's never forgotten her. He'd do anything for her then, and he'd do anything for her now. When Aimi tells him that she wants to escape her abusive husband, Billy agrees to help her fake her own death. But is she still the Aimi that Billy remembers from all those years ago? Once Aimi disappears, Billy has to face the possibility that perhaps she had different reasons for disappearing - reasons that might be more dangerous than she's led him to believe ... Sometimes trusting the one you love is the wrong thing to do.\"--Provided by publisher. \u003cbr\u003e\n Dimensions:129 x 198  \u003cbr\u003e\n Author: Minett \u003cbr\u003e\n ISBN: 9781785763885 \u003cbr\u003e\n Format:  \u003cbr\u003e\n Pages 368\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":44896132595865,"sku":"13RA9781785763885","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/2c3c76585e72cb4d863e012f8fc539ad.jpg?v=1728897110","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/anything-for-her","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}